SUMMARY:Adult Laser Tag - Edgewater
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nNxGn Arena\
 , 43 The Promenade\, Edgewater\, offers adult laser tag!! So\, here we go.
  We'll be heading there at 5 p.m. Saturday\, Nov. 28. The event idea comes
  to you courtesy of Osama and our WhatsApp group chat.\n\nWe're planning t
 o book a private event with an hour of adult laser tag\, four pizzas and a
 ccess to arcade games. The total will be about $65 per person\, but I'll n
 eed $30 up front from each person to secure the reservation.\n\nPAYMENT IN
 FO: I've got Venmo\, Zelle\, PayPal and Cash App. Try to locate my account
  with my email first. andymilone@verizon.net Or it may show up under my na
 me Andy Milone or Andrew Milone. Or try 201-406-7222. You can try my other
  number\, 201-234-9609\, BUT PLEASE DON'T USE IT FOR VENMO! That is no lon
 ger my account. Thank you everyone!!! Feel free to reach out with any ques
 tions!!\n\nI'll keep you updated as we get closer to the date. Here is the
  website: https://nxgnarena.com\n\n\\*\\*\\*There is a good chance we'll h
 ang out some more at a diner or bar afterward. Feel free to make suggestio
 ns!! \\*\\*\\*\n\nThis is our first laser tag event. Feel free to also che
 ck out bowling\, soccer\, volleyball\, tennis or one of our other activiti
 es at: www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball.\n\nQuestions
  or comments? You can message Andy on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234
 -9609.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316744336/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260928T034248Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260928T034248Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
