SUMMARY:Fasting and Prayer Group for Christians Online
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nLet’s joi
 n together in the meetup group chat to plan and discuss fasting and prayer
  session....UPDATE: We can decide a duration or each one can do a duration
  they are able to. We can decide if we want to fast for a common cause. Th
 ere is power in prayer and fasting for Christians and even more so when we
  come together to do it. Just like in the Book of Esther\; while her peopl
 e were being persecuted\, they came together to do a 3 day fast and call o
 ut to the Lord. God heard their cries and flipped the situation so they en
 ded up benefiting from an event meant to wipe them out.\n\\* This is not a
  weight loss program.\n\\* I’m not a medical professional and can’t te
 ll you if you are able to fast. You can consult with your doctor.\n\\*We c
 an join the meetup’s event chat Thursday to talk and plan.\n\\*I’m ope
 n to ideas and suggestions\, just message me and let me know\, or leave a 
 comment.\n\\*Let me know if you have any questions.
