SUMMARY:Dave & Buster's Time - Woodbridge
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nWe're headi
 ng back to Dave & Buster's this holiday season.\n\nA bit further south tha
 n usual!\n\nStill the same air hockey\, basketball shooting\, arcade and b
 oardwalk games\, great food and drinks! Televisions are also on site. You 
 pay for yourself.\n\nThis Dave & Buster's is inside the Woodbridge Center!
  The address is listed as 274 Woodbridge Center Dr\, Woodbridge Township.\
 n\nOf course\, show up anytime!!! We may hang out some more afterward at a
  local diner or bar. Feel free to make suggestions.\n\nMore info can be fo
 und at: www.daveandbusters.com/us/en/about/locations/woodbridge-middlesex\
 n\nHope you'll consider joining us for our third trip to Dave & Buster's o
 r at another group event. Questions? Ideas? Concerns? Feel free to comment
  below or call/text Andy Milone at 201-234-9609.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/317168879/
