SUMMARY:Late Night Poker - Jersey City
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nWe're hopin
 g to host regular poker nights going forward.\n\nLet's start in the new ye
 ar! Zeppelin Hall is a great spot and already holds game nights on Fridays
 . The place can be found at 88 Liberty View Dr.\, Jersey City\, and offers
  a huge parking lot.\n\nI'll have at least one deck of cards and a bag of 
 small chips. Post below if you'll be bringing your own. I know Texas Hold'
 em and at least one other poker game.\n\nQuestions or comments? You can me
 ssage Andy on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609. Hope you'll join 
 us for our first "Late Night Poker."
